     "text": "Military life can be filled with unexpected challenges."
    },
    {
     "start": 10.0,
     "end": 14.44,
     "text": "For more than 120 years, the Navy Marine Corps Relief Society has been a lifeline, providing"
    },
    {
     "start": 14.44,
     "end": 18.0,
     "text": "assistance to Marines, Sailors, and their family members."
    },
    {
     "start": 18.0,
     "end": 25.44,
     "text": "In 2025, the Navy Marine Corps Relief Society provided $47 million in support to 211,000"
    },
    {
     "start": 25.44,
     "end": 26.44,
     "text": "Marines and Sailors."
    },
    {
     "start": 26.44,
     "end": 31.44,
     "text": "None of this would be possible without your generous donations."
    },
    {
     "start": 31.44,
     "end": 36.0,
     "text": "From living expenses, transportation needs, operating thrift stores, to helping new and"
    },
    {
     "start": 36.0,
     "end": 40.32,
     "text": "expecting parents with Okinawa's first-of-its-kind visiting nurse, the Navy Marine Corps Relief"
    },
    {
     "start": 40.32,
     "end": 46.32,
     "text": "Society is there when you need it most."
    },
    {
     "start": 46.32,
     "end": 50.84,
     "text": "The 2026 Active Duty Fund Drive runs from 1 March to 30 April."
    },
    {
     "start": 50.84,
     "end": 54.04,
     "text": "Always remember, the Navy Marine Corps Relief Society is here to help you handle life's"
    },
    {
     "start": 54.04,
     "end": 57.08,
     "text": "obstacles so you can stay focused on our critical mission."
    },
    {
     "start": 57.08,
     "end": 59.0,
     "text": "Thank you and Semper Fidelis!"
    }
   ],
